From efa44980706a7ce1ce8eb1a6003aaad1aeda4daa Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: cpkt9762 <cpkt9762@163.com>
Date: Mon, 26 Oct 2026 04:39:55 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] feat(projects): rename a project into another with engram
 projects rename

Preview and move current local ownership across unrelated project names while
preserving immutable sync and authorization evidence. Back up SQLite before
applying, carry enrollment, and enqueue enrolled current content for re-push.

Refuse to apply while autosync holds an active sync lease and the source still
has unacknowledged pending mutations, so an in-flight push cannot acknowledge
rows that the rename already moved. Preview reports pending, quarantined and
keyed-prompt risks and the lease state before any backup is taken.

Co-Authored-By: Codex (gpt-6.1-sol) <noreply@openai.com>
